  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the assignment is to plan, prepare and produce a repository of stories and results from the FSF and mapping of policy opportunities on a quarterly basis made available to MIGSTAB from which three newsletters, SoMe and other outputs will be developed and made available to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs. The Ministry will share the newsletter and stories on digital media as well as with relevant stakeholders including The Danish Parliament.</narrative>
